  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Girl Climate Corps Fellowship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022, G4CA aims to empower 170 girl/young women climate leaders through our programs in 3 cities (Jinja, Mbale and Kasese). Young women and girls suffer the impacts of climate change first hand. The project will bring together young women and girls from indigenous and marginalised communities to be trained in climate leadership, activism, adaptation, mitigation and movement building. These will be empowered to contribute to local decision making and holding their leaders accountable.</narrative>
  </description>
